# Build context for the inbound mail service (audit 2.0 SEC-31). This container
# parses hostile internet input, so the image holds exactly the Haraka config,
# the entrypoint, and a lockfile-reproducible dependency tree — nothing else.
#
# Allowlist, same shape as the repo-root .dockerignore: deny everything, then
# name the few paths the build actually needs. Note `npm ci` installs from the
# lockfile, so a local node_modules must never enter the context.
*
!Dockerfile
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!docker-entrypoint.sh
!haraka

node_modules
**/node_modules
